      ],
      "pause_after_seconds": 1,
      "inflection": "settled",
      "pronunciation_notes": []
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "P007",
      "anchor": "Two things can be true at once. A ticket can be an authentic winner, and th",
      "pace": "natural",
      "intent": "curious",
      "emphasis": [
        "Two things can be true at once"
      ],
      "pause_after_seconds": 1,
      "inflection": "curious question",
      "pronunciation_notes": []
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "P010",
      "anchor": "One example from court papers, reported in August 2001, shows the incentive",
