      ],
      "pause_after_seconds": 1,
      "inflection": "settled",
      "pronunciation_notes": []
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "P013",
      "anchor": "One early example showed what those networks could deliver. In a 1995 claim",
      "pace": "natural",
      "intent": "curious",
      "emphasis": [
